title: Start
---
Capsley: Hello and welcome to the [b]Yarn Spinner for Godot[/b] samples

<<start_slide>>
SlideHeader: Agenda
SlideBullet: Yarn Spinner
SlideBullet: Why it's so great
SlideBullet: The list of samples
<<end_slide>>

Capsley: Let's get cracking!

<<clear_slide>>
<<start_slide>>
SlideImage: code-1
<<end_slide>>

Capsley: In case you haven't seen it, this is what [b]Yarn[/b] looks like
Capsley: For a full syntax guide please see the [link="yarnspinner.dev/docs/yarn/02-fundamentals/" external=true]website[/link].
Capsley: The Yarn file for this sample is [link="Intro.yarn"]here[/link].

<<clear_slide>>
<<start_slide>>
SlideHeader: Why is Yarn Spinner Great?
SlideBullet: It just is
SlideBullet: Trust us on that
<<end_slide>>

Capsley: I feel like this is obvious enough, let's move on to the samples

<<jump SampleSelection>>
===

